# 𓂀 STACK 03: ORGANISMS, REALMS, ATLAS, TERMINALS 𓂀
## Organismi, Regna, Atlas, Terminalia • Ὀργανισμοί, Βασίλεια, Ἄτλας
### OCL · RSL · ACL · TPL

---

## ☰ STACK MANIFEST
```
Stack:          03 — ORGANISMS, REALMS, ATLAS, TERMINALS
